                <pb facs="0477" n="371" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg371"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-04-15"><hi rendition="#italic">April 15,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(The minister is informed that the department approves the proposed amendments of
                    the Shanghai mixed court rules sent him by Consul-General Goodnow, and he is
                    instructed to urge the adoption of them.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
